py_progs
a variety of useful python scripts for use with ExoCAM

sys.in 	     	    	        -- contains system information (paths)
exocampy_tools.py               -- a collection of standard tools for manipulating CAM files
mod_ncdata.py                   -- modify CAM .i. files (ncdata): vertical levels,
                                   surface pressure (flat/scaled), dry. Importable
                                   (modify_ncdata) and a CLI; replaces the IDL
                                   changevert_cesm.pro / changepress_cesm.pro.
broadband_albedo_calculator.py  -- SED-weighted snow and ice broadband albedos for
                                   user_nl_cice. CLI, or import compute_albedo /
                                   compute_cice_albedos (used by exocam-casemgr prep)
